a. In its assessment of the Appellant's risk in Bulawayo, the proposed IFA;
b. By finding that it is reasonable for Ms. XXXX to live in Bulawayo;
c. In finding Ms. XXXX not credible based on her knowledge of her husband's political activities; and
d. That the RPD failed to provide an analysis of the decades of abuse, inability to obtain police protection, and reasons for fearing future persecution.
RAD Analysis of the Appeal

